{"5052630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kazfall", "steam_appid": 5052630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/extras/a37c4b4cf6ef0649134bb079264070a7.poster.avif?t=1788354769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/extras/a37c4b4cf6ef0649134bb079264070a7.webm?t=1788354769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/extras/a37c4b4cf6ef0649134bb079264070a7.mp4?t=1788354769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO KAZFALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The keep fell. The vaults beneath it fell. Everyone who ever held the place went down with it.<br>Something else lives there now and it did not come from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This dungeon does not open because you got stronger. It opens because you found who is left.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vendor </strong>still trades from a lantern-lit corner, having lugged his wares through hell to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >reach you. What he sells lasts one delve only — the depths keep what they're given.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Artificer</strong> waits deeper still, and what he forges endures. Every upgrade is bound to you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and carried into every run after.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Hierophant</strong> tends an altar nobody has knelt at in a long time. He offers covenants: take on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a curse, walk the harder road, and the depths repay your suffering with greater glory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one you reach permanently opens the place further — new rooms, new enemies, a new boss and a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tier of gear that did not exist for you before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/extras/516249766d19c8a0340ffa71f7e35ec0.poster.avif?t=1788354769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/extras/516249766d19c8a0340ffa71f7e35ec0.webm?t=1788354769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/extras/516249766d19c8a0340ffa71f7e35ec0.mp4?t=1788354769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ONE DESCENT, AND A CLOCK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A run is a single unbroken delve against a countdown. There is no safe backtracking and no grinding a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >floor for scraps — the timer takes you if the dungeon doesn't. Reach the boss, kill it, and climb out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The steel you found stays down there. What you carry back up is worth more than any of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COMBAT THAT ASKS SOMETHING OF YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weave light and heavy</strong> into three-hit chains that cost stamina. Swing carelessly and you have</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >nothing left to defend with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect block</strong> on the frame the blow lands: you take no damage and open enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >up. Mistime it and your guard breaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple enemy types</strong> that fight differently — lancers that close, spearwraiths that keep their</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >distance, obelisks that shield everything around them until you deal with them first.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILD A RUN OUT OF WHAT THE FLOOR GIVES YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>63 pieces of equipment</strong> — burn, freeze, thorns, lifesteal, crit, and armour that retaliates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >against whoever hit you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>29 skills </strong>— 15 active and 14 passive, with an Ultimate unlocked at level 20.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chests as a reward</strong>— scrap what you don't want and re-roll with the gold it earns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Covenants</strong> from the Hierophant multiply your score — and make the descent meaningfully worse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE DEPTHS KEEP WHAT THEY'RE GIVEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold</strong> lives and dies with the delve: the Vendor's stock, chest rewards, potions. None of it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >comes back up with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Essence</strong> does. Buy permanent stat upgrades, weapons and unlocked gear at your Antechamber</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >before the next descent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dying is not a wasted run. Dying is the economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILT TO BE PLAYED HOW YOU PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong>, with native PlayStation, Xbox and Steam Deck button prompts that</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >follow the pad you actually plugged in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility</strong> — colourblind modes, UI scaling, brightness calibration, a light-flicker toggle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and a damage-number toggle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/extras/a37c4b4cf6ef0649134bb079264070a7.poster.avif?t=1788354769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/extras/a37c4b4cf6ef0649134bb079264070a7.webm?t=1788354769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/extras/a37c4b4cf6ef0649134bb079264070a7.mp4?t=1788354769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WELCOME TO KAZFALL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The keep fell. The vaults beneath it fell. Everyone who ever held the place went down with it.<br>Something else lives there now and it did not come from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This dungeon does not open because you got stronger. It opens because you found who is left.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Vendor </strong>still trades from a lantern-lit corner, having lugged his wares through hell to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >reach you. What he sells lasts one delve only — the depths keep what they're given.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Artificer</strong> waits deeper still, and what he forges endures. Every upgrade is bound to you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and carried into every run after.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Hierophant</strong> tends an altar nobody has knelt at in a long time. He offers covenants: take on</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a curse, walk the harder road, and the depths repay your suffering with greater glory.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one you reach permanently opens the place further — new rooms, new enemies, a new boss and a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tier of gear that did not exist for you before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/extras/516249766d19c8a0340ffa71f7e35ec0.poster.avif?t=1788354769\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/extras/516249766d19c8a0340ffa71f7e35ec0.webm?t=1788354769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/extras/516249766d19c8a0340ffa71f7e35ec0.mp4?t=1788354769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ONE DESCENT, AND A CLOCK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A run is a single unbroken delve against a countdown. There is no safe backtracking and no grinding a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >floor for scraps — the timer takes you if the dungeon doesn't. Reach the boss, kill it, and climb out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The steel you found stays down there. What you carry back up is worth more than any of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COMBAT THAT ASKS SOMETHING OF YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weave light and heavy</strong> into three-hit chains that cost stamina. Swing carelessly and you have</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >nothing left to defend with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect block</strong> on the frame the blow lands: you take no damage and open enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >up. Mistime it and your guard breaks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple enemy types</strong> that fight differently — lancers that close, spearwraiths that keep their</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >distance, obelisks that shield everything around them until you deal with them first.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILD A RUN OUT OF WHAT THE FLOOR GIVES YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>63 pieces of equipment</strong> — burn, freeze, thorns, lifesteal, crit, and armour that retaliates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >against whoever hit you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>29 skills </strong>— 15 active and 14 passive, with an Ultimate unlocked at level 20.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chests as a reward</strong>— scrap what you don't want and re-roll with the gold it earns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Covenants</strong> from the Hierophant multiply your score — and make the descent meaningfully worse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE DEPTHS KEEP WHAT THEY'RE GIVEN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold</strong> lives and dies with the delve: the Vendor's stock, chest rewards, potions. None of it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >comes back up with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Essence</strong> does. Buy permanent stat upgrades, weapons and unlocked gear at your Antechamber</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >before the next descent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dying is not a wasted run. Dying is the economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILT TO BE PLAYED HOW YOU PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full controller support</strong>, with native PlayStation, Xbox and Steam Deck button prompts that</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >follow the pad you actually plugged in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessibility</strong> — colourblind modes, UI scaling, brightness calibration, a light-flicker toggle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and a damage-number toggle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A fantasy action roguelite of timed descents. Fight on stamina and frame-perfect blocks, build every run from the gear and skills the dungeon gives you, and carry Essence out to keep.", "supported_languages": "English, Polish, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/36c3aee3f60da8cbf8df514d1b2ca3b8a3ded688/header.jpg?t=1788354769", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/ed7ff723e9578ad5dd7fdd35296f69a077a0b0c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788354769", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052630/ed7ff723e9578ad5dd7fdd35296f69a077a0b0c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788354769", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / AMD RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 6 GB / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["CzaJuan Studio"], "publishers": ["CzaJuan Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 64, "description": "Adjustable Text Size"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 80, "description": "#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"}, {"id